      "title": "PURVA: South And Mumbai Launch Pipeline Will Drive Future Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have maintained Puravankara's price target at ₹400.00 as they balance a revised set of assumptions, including updated discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin, and future P/E inputs. What's in the News Board meeting on May 18, 2026 to consider and approve audited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2026, review the statutory audit report, reappoint the cost auditor, confirm the appointment and remuneration of Chief Risk Officer Mr. Amit Narain Ahuja as Senior Managerial Personnel from May 4, 2026, and address other business matters.",
