      "date": "2026-05-20T12:30:37.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: Revenues exceed analysts expectations while EPS lags behind",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.69 (up from ₹7.58 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹38.5b (up 90% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹637.1m (up ₹2.44b from FY 2025). Profit margin: 1.7% (up from net loss in FY 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 14%. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates by 58%. Revenue is forecast to grow 2.5% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 22% growth forecast for the Real Estate industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 112 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
